{"slug":"isekai-izakaya-koto-aitheria-no-izakaya-nobu","ad":"Isekai Izakaya: Koto Aitheria no Izakaya Nobu","adEn":"Isekai Izakaya: Japanese Food From Another World","yil":2018,"puan":71,"format":"ONA","durum":"FINISHED","sezon":"SPRING","sure":14,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1303/90909.jpg","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/97873-l4yCDbvyILbU.jpg","ozet":"Izakaya “Nobu” is a modest establishment, staffed by only two people: master, Nobuyuki Yazawa, and server, Shinobu Senke.\n\nDespite its humble appearance, its entrance is mysteriously connected to an ancient city from another world: “Aitheria.” Nobu’s patrons consist of lazy palace guards, incognito clergymen, and the Waterworks Guildmaster – certainly not your average clientele!\n\nBut once they enter Nobu’s doors, they are greeted with the finest alcohol they’ve ever tasted and dishes the likes of which they’ve never seen. With the food plentiful and the drinks flowing, the patrons leave their troubles at the door as they call, “Give me a cold ale, master!”\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","turler":["Komedi","Fantastik","Günlük Yaşam","Isekai","Kadın Başrol","Erkek Başrol"],"iliski":[],"seri":null,"fragman":{"site":"youtube","id":"NWjYkDKRVUY"},"yasal":[{"a":"Crunchyroll","u":"http://www.crunchyroll.com/isekai-izakaya-japanese-food-from-another-world"}],"kaynakSayisi":106,"bolumSayisi":24,"bolumler":[{"n":1,"no":"1","ad":"1. Bölüm","slug":"isekai-izakaya-koto-aitheria-no-izakaya-nobu-1-bolum","ks":6,"ekip":[{"g":"Tempest","e":"vaisravana"}],"src":[["MAIL","Tempest","https://my.mail.ru/mail/kuro0neko5/video/embed/_myvideo/7","ok"],["MAIL","Tempest","https://my.mail.ru/video/embed/3095424634359659946","ok"],["VK","Tempest","https://href.li/?https://vk.com/video_ext.php?oid=519138726&id=456239099&hash=f08d470b34e2a5cd&hd=1","ok"],["ODNOKLASSNIKI","Tempest","https://odnoklassniki.ru/videoembed/1505710967399","ok"],["SIBNET","Tempest","https://video.sibnet.ru/shell.php